━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
+ FocusProbeBox is Box

• This
    focus-mode = FocusMode.press

+ name String
+ trace [String]
+ probe-native-focus-handle Pointer?
+ focus-enabled = true
+ focus-count Size = 0
+ blur-count Size = 0
+ click-count Size = 0
+ focus-state-was-current = false
+ blur-state-was-current = false
+ native-focus-handle => probe-native-focus-handle
+ is-focus-enabled => focus-enabled

────────────────────
+ This
    - name
    - trace

────────────────────
for event on focus

focus-count += 1
focus-state-was-current = is-focused
trace += "$name:focus"

────────────────────
for event on blur

blur-count += 1
blur-state-was-current = !is-focused
trace += "$name:blur"

────────────────────
for event on click

click-count += 1
trace += "$name:click"
